	<string>https://www.jamf.com/resources/product-documentation/jamf-setup-and-reset-configuration-guide/</string>
	<key>pfm_description</key>
	<string>Configure Jamf Reset, the Jamf Pro app that lets a technician erase a shared iPhone or iPad on the spot and hand it to the next user. Reset talks to Jamf Pro to issue the wipe, so the device stays enrolled and re-enrols itself through Automated Device Enrolment.</string>
